WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.958
The cutaway follows one hook from the front of the lock.

00:00:00.958 --> 00:00:01.583
The hook meets resistance at pin 1.

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:03.208
The core supports the driver at pin 1. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:04.750
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.375
The hook meets resistance at pin 2.

00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:05.625
The core supports the driver at pin 2. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.000
As pin 2 clears, the core turns farther. Pin 3 stops it before the lock can open.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.417
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:09.958
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:10.417
Pin 3 still blocks the core. Its wide lower end is below the shear line.

00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:11.625
The widening shoulder pushes the core back as the hook lifts.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.000
The core moves back under pin 2. Its spring pushes the driver down.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.958
The core supports the driver at pin 3. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:16.500
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.125
The hook meets resistance at pin 2.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:19.625
The core supports the driver at pin 2. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:20.167
All the drivers are clear. The lower pins turn with the core.

